{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>面對日益嚴峻的勞動力短缺問題，有日本鐵路營運公司引入AI機械人，前往偏遠地區執行各項設備檢查工作。其中西武鐵道於十月正式引入配備人工智能的自主運作機械人，藉此減輕前線人手壓力，並維持日常檢查質素。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-10-21 182602.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RUaiNi60Xg1792579747.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p><strong>配備1.8米伸縮桿　自動監測電壓溫度異常</strong></p><p></p><p>機械人設有一根可伸展至1.8米的伸縮桿，內部裝設鏡頭及溫度計，持續監測記錄電壓、電流以及溫度的儀器運作。當系統在相關監測儀器偵測到任何異常或故障時，便會即時向工作人員發出警報，以便跟進。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-10-21 182645.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dofdkOWF3T1792579708.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:58:59.783763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:13.944222+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:56:06.778031+00:00","content_hash":"202b50786d0d530cd77c6b4d6f0f1668cdfe4066df6fceb0dde98beb832e854c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}